## 3. Third-Party Source Documents Notice
The original source PDF documents referenced by this dataset are official publications, reports, decisions, and bulletins issued by Vietnamese governmental bodies (Cục Thủy lợi, Cục Quản lý đê điều và Phòng, chống thiên tai, Văn phòng Chính phủ) and research institutes (Viện Quy hoạch Thủy lợi Miền Nam). 

These documents are referenced by public URL, title, issuing organization, and cryptographic SHA-256 hash. The VietIRR-RAG project does not claim copyright over the underlying governmental source texts. Users must comply with the public access terms and policies of the respective issuing agencies when retrieving or utilizing raw source documents.
